sequenceDiagram
  participant Dr as Dr. Example One
  participant R as Receptionist R1
  participant Acc as Accountant
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API
  participant W as Worker jobs
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  Dr->>Web: Close day, decide cancel or transfer for each waiting patient
  Web->>API: PATCH /queue/sessions/:id/close
  API->>PG: patients cancelled or transferred, session closed
  W->>PG: every 60 seconds, mark late bookings no_show
  W->>PG: every 5 minutes, close empty sessions of past days
  R->>Web: Payments, choose the day
  Web->>API: GET /payments/daily-collection
  API-->>Web: receipts, refunds, net per account
  Acc->>Web: Close counter, counted amount per account
  Web->>API: POST /billing/cash-close
  API->>PG: cash_closes and cash_close_lines, audit row
  W->>PG: 01:00 expire prepaid patient credits
  W->>PG: 02:30 billing invariant check, log only
  W->>PG: 03:15 queue cleanup of old keys and outbox rows
  W->>PG: 08:00 inventory alert count, server log only
